-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this license / upstream-derived code
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The BSD-2-Clause grant above covers the ORIGINAL contributions authored for
this repository (build tooling, scripts, documentation, and the SpacemiT K1
driver work authored by Daniel Shue). It does NOT relicense third-party or
upstream-derived material.

Several files carry their own SPDX-License-Identifier header, which governs
that file and takes precedence over this top-level LICENSE. In particular:

  * archive/freebsd/            - FreeBSD/OpenBSD-derived kernel drivers. Most are
                              BSD-2-Clause (c) Daniel Shue; some retain
                              additional upstream terms, e.g.:
                                - archive/freebsd/pmap.c ........... BSD-4-Clause
                                  (FreeBSD-derived)
                                - archive/freebsd/if_smte.c ........ BSD-2-Clause
                                  AND ISC (portions (c) Mark Kettenis, OpenBSD)
                                - archive/freebsd/if_smtereg.h ..... ISC (OpenBSD)
  * archive/freebsd/brcmfmac/   - Broadcom fullmac Wi-Fi driver port. ISC-licensed;
                              see archive/freebsd/brcmfmac/LICENSE.
  * archive/freebsd/dts/        - Device trees derived from Linux. GPL-2.0 OR MIT
                              (per the upstream SpacemiT/mainline DTS).
  * archive/rv2/firmware/ap6256/    - Redistributable Broadcom binary firmware. NOT
                              covered by this license; governed by
                              archive/rv2/firmware/ap6256/LICENSE.brcm80211.

OPNsense-derived pieces, where present, remain under OPNsense's own
BSD-2-Clause terms. This repository does not relicense any upstream FreeBSD,
OpenBSD, Linux, OPNsense, or Broadcom code; each such file keeps the license
under which it was received. See NOTICE for a summary.
